From 6b6715d1cfd6e45f4a636dde9286c00c393ae91f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Ellegaard <tim.ellegaard@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:17:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Download a project as a zip and open a zip as a project

Adds Download as zip and Open a project zip to the project menu, so a
project can move between machines, such as cloud pods with no lasting
disk. Downloads stream as they are packed and can carry the timeline's
takes, every take, or no renders. Uploads go in 32 MB parts so proxies
that cap request bodies do not stop large projects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JCCPHHtqCH84VoSzGnJap3
