+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- **Project archives.** The project menu has **Download as zip** and **Open a
+  project zip**, to take a project to another machine or a fresh cloud pod and
+  carry on there. A download carries the takes on the timeline, every take, or
+  no renders, and the dialog shows how large each choice is. For agents:
+  `GET /project/{name}/archive`, `POST /archive/part` and `POST /archive/open`.
+
